Derivative works of third-party models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no model weights. It does contain, and distributes through
the companion dataset https://huggingface.co/datasets/drmhse/tts-rs-assets, artifacts
derived from three third-party models. Each is licensed Apache-2.0 by its authors, and
that licence reaches the derived artifacts.

1. Audio8-TTS-Preview-0.6b
   https://huggingface.co/Audio8/Audio8-TTS-Preview-0.6b
   Licence: Apache-2.0
   Revision recorded: f9612f13a0ab40facf3d050fc908b9e6db05c2be

   Derived here:
     fixtures/audio8/oracle.safetensors              per-stage fp32 activations
     fixtures/audio8/default_voice_codes.safetensors reference speech codes
     voices/cosy-default/                            voice asset from reference audio

2. Fun-CosyVoice3-0.5B
   https://huggingface.co/FunAudioLLM/Fun-CosyVoice3-0.5B
   Upstream code: https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/CosyVoice
   Licence: Apache-2.0
   Revision recorded: 29e01c4e8d000f4bcd70751be16fa94bf3d85a18

   Derived here:
     fixtures/cosyvoice/oracle.safetensors           per-stage fp32 activations
     references/cosyvoice/weights/rand_noise.safetensors
                                                     tensor drawn by the model's
                                                     constructor under seed 0
     references/cosyvoice/weights/tokenizer.json     tokenizer serialised by upstream
                                                     CosyVoice3Tokenizer code
     voices/cosy-default-cosyvoice/                  voice asset from reference audio

3. Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base
   https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base
   Licence: Apache-2.0
   Revision recorded: fd4b254389122332181a7c3db7f27e918eec64e3

   Derived here:
     fixtures/qwen3tts/oracle.safetensors            per-stage fp32 activations
     voices/cosy-default-qwen3tts/                   voice asset from reference audio

The revisions above are each repository's HEAD as read on 2026-08-12 and are recorded so
that later drift is diagnosable. The artifacts themselves were produced in late July and
early August 2026; where an upstream repository moved in between, the revision named here
is the later one.

Statement of changes, per Apache-2.0 section 4(b): none of the above are the upstream
models. They are activations computed by them, tensors drawn by their constructors,
tokenizers serialised by their code, or speaker assets encoded from reference audio they
ship. The Rust reimplementations in crates/ were written against these models' published
architectures and deliberately differ from them in the ways documented in
docs/porting/ and docs/status.md.
